    "backstory": "Once a slick-talking timebroker peddling glimpses of pre-apocalyptic paradise on the Dark Swarm, Chrono Clutch lost his beak in a deal gone sideways. Now, he haunts the Snailer's Hut, hawking salvaged tech and whispered secrets while dodging vengeful clients and the ever-encroaching rot.",
    "class": "Tinkerer",
